{"hero":{"eyebrow":"STARDEW VALLEY AI COMPANION · DEVELOPMENT JOURNAL","title":"一个伙伴，","line2":"正在代码里长大。","description":"从读懂一座农场，到规划跨日生活。沿着真实更新，看看一个《星露谷物语》AI 伙伴如何逐步成形。","status":"开发与测试中","sourcePath":"README.md"},"pillars":[{"title":"读懂真实的农场","description":"由透明桥读取游戏状态，让时间、物品与地图成为计划的依据。","sourcePath":"src/StardewAI.TransparentBridge/State/TransparentStateCollector.cs","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zalataraglados-prog/StardewValleyAICompanion/blob/b6ba033bcd9ce6590b92cadb78177e8ac502d409/src/StardewAI.TransparentBridge/State/TransparentStateCollector.cs"},{"title":"把计划落实到行动","description":"候选、日计划、动作队列和执行器连成一条链，按原版机制推进任务。","sourcePath":"docs/COMPANION_PRODUCT_ROADMAP_CN.md","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zalataraglados-prog/StardewValleyAICompanion/blob/b6ba033bcd9ce6590b92cadb78177e8ac502d409/docs/COMPANION_PRODUCT_ROADMAP_CN.md"},{"title":"让每一步有据可查","description":"保留执行回执与新鲜状态，区分完成、受阻和等待后再规划。","sourcePath":"docs/CURRENT_STATUS_CN.md","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zalataraglados-prog/StardewValleyAICompanion/blob/b6ba033bcd9ce6590b92cadb78177e8ac502d409/docs/CURRENT_STATUS_CN.md"}],"roadmap":[{"title":"01 · 长期单机能力","description":"从新档爷爷评分 21/21，推进到可重复的原生 Perfection 100%。","status":"阶段目标","sourcePath":"docs/COMPANION_PRODUCT_ROADMAP_CN.md","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zalataraglados-prog/StardewValleyAICompanion/blob/b6ba033bcd9ce6590b92cadb78177e8ac502d409/docs/COMPANION_PRODUCT_ROADMAP_CN.md"},{"title":"02 · 学会一起生活","description":"在单机基线完成后，进入长期真实联机，学习分工、礼让和合作节奏。","status":"后续目标","sourcePath":"docs/COMPANION_PRODUCT_ROADMAP_CN.md","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zalataraglados-prog/StardewValleyAICompanion/blob/b6ba033bcd9ce6590b92cadb78177e8ac502d409/docs/COMPANION_PRODUCT_ROADMAP_CN.md"},{"title":"03 · 成为你的伙伴","description":"逐步补全独立角色、偏好与记忆、声音和自然语言委托，再走向稳定产品。","status":"长期目标","sourcePath":"docs/COMPANION_PRODUCT_ROADMAP_CN.md","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zalataraglados-prog/StardewValleyAICompanion/blob/b6ba033bcd9ce6590b92cadb78177e8ac502d409/docs/COMPANIO